# What this plugin needs from outside Hammerspoon.
# Format is name | kind | locator | policy | reason. See Olm's lib/deps.lua.
# Both required, since this plugin is nothing but a thin front end onto them, with no
# partial service to offer if either is gone. defaults reads and writes the stored
# preference. osascript is what an empirical check on 2026-08-09 found actually makes the
# running Dock notice the change right away, see this plugin's own CLAUDE.md for the
# finding. Neither is a real risk on any machine this runs on, both ship with every macOS,
# so required here documents the contract rather than guarding against a practical absence.
defaults  | system | /usr/bin/defaults  | required | reading and writing the Dock's auto hide preference
osascript | system | /usr/bin/osascript | required | telling the running Dock to notice the change immediately
